{"parse":{"title":"特性/霜狼共鸣","pageid":7300,"revid":17424,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E5%85%B1%E9%B8%A3&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E5%85%B1%E9%B8%A3&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E5%85%B1%E9%B8%A3&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>霜狼共鸣</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.9C.9C.E7.8B.BC.E5.85.B1.E9.B8.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"霜狼共鸣\"><b>霜狼共鸣</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原狼王.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%8B%BC%E7%8E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%8B%BC%E7%8E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />霜狼共鸣\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响。处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格上时，魔攻、物防额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，且行动结束时，额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。受到环境伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>；受到百分比伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]时，有以下效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>；<br />✦受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">90%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">80%</font>范围魔法伤害，并使地形格变成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。<br />✦被击退时，有<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>概率受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E8%90%A8%E6%BB%A1\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/霜狼萨满\"><img alt=\"霜狼萨满 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/97/g6oljl8wn0juf9cj25vvtezdzht4trz.png/75px-%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E8%90%A8%E6%BB%A1_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/97/g6oljl8wn0juf9cj25vvtezdzht4trz.png/113px-%E9%9C%9C%E7%8B%BC%E8%90%A8%E6%BB%A1_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/97/g6oljl8wn0juf9cj25vvtezdzht4trz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 642/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13503/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3860/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   97.939      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   97.939      1 -total\n 58.68%   57.470      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 53.12%   52.021      5 模板:中括号介绍\n 10.19%    9.983      1 模板:面包屑\n  6.35%    6.223      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7300-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164200 and revision id 17424. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_冰原狼王.png","霜狼萨满_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>霜狼共鸣</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"霜狼共鸣"}],"displaytitle":"特性/霜狼共鸣","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=霜狼萨满\n|特性名称=霜狼共鸣\n|特性图标=冰原狼王\n|特性描述=免疫[<font color=#f3c156>冰冻</font>]地形格影响。处于[冰冻]地形格上时，魔攻、物防额外提高<font color=#ed7950>10%</font